Complete Timeline
All of this happens in milliseconds:
DNS Lookup: ~20-120ms
TCP Connection: ~20-50ms
SSL Handshake: ~50-150ms
Request to Server: ~10-50ms
Server Processing: ~50-200ms
Response Transfer: ~20-100ms
Browser Rendering: ~50-200ms